      </div>
      <div class="az-scorecard">
        <span class="az-scorecard-label">Completeness${info("% of stat fields that have a value (including N/A). Blank stats count as a loss in the actual game, so filling them all in matters.")}</span>
        <span class="az-scorecard-val ${completePct>=0.9?'color-good':completePct>=0.7?'color-ok':'color-warn'}">${Math.round(completePct*100)}<span style="font-size:16px;font-weight:500">%</span></span>
        <span class="az-scorecard-sub">${Math.round(completePct*100) === 100 ? 'All stats filled' : 'Some stats missing'}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="az-scorecard">
